01:03:09,473 --> 01:03:15,473
Bodied is a 2017 American battle rap comedy-drama film directed by Joseph Kahn, written by
Alex Larsen and produced by Eminem, his manager Paul Rosenberg, and Adi Shankar.

11
01:09:28,421 --> 01:09:34,421
The film premiered at the 2017 Toronto International Film Festival.

12
01:15:47,368 --> 01:15:53,368
It stars Calum Worthy as Adam, a graduate student who becomes a competitive battle rapper after
becoming immersed in the scene while working on his graduate thesis on the subject.

13
01:22:06,315 --> 01:22:12,315
At the Toronto International Film Festival, the film won the Toronto
International Film Festival People's Choice Award: Midnight Madness.

14
01:28:25,263 --> 01:28:31,263
It also won Fantastic Fest's 2017 Audience Award.

15
01:34:44,210 --> 01:34:50,210
In January 2018, YouTube Red announced it had acquired exclusive streaming rights,
with a limited theatrical release beginning on November 2, 2018.

16
01:41:03,157 --> 01:41:09,157
Upon the film's release, it received generally positive reviews from critics who
praised its humour and meaningful exploration of certain dark themes.

17
01:47:22,105 --> 01:47:28,105
The film explores themes of rap music, hip-hop, cat, college, thesis.

18
01:53:41,052 --> 01:53:47,052
The tone is lighthearted and emotional.
